54821\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2592160/extras/3061c56ef06b833f077d35400c47a2aa.webm?t=1770854821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2592160/extras/3061c56ef06b833f077d35400c47a2aa.mp4?t=1770854821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Managing heroes sometimes goes beyond their powers. Each hero comes with quirks, flaws, and baggage you’ll need to navigate to keep the team together. Upgrade their skills and unlock abilities to boost their effectiveness in the field.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Blending narrative, strategy, and humor, <i>Dispatch</i> explores what it means to be a hero, whether you're wearing a cape or behind a desk.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2592160/extras/186db654236f407100f8b5ad2bbef891.poster.avif?t=1770854821\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2592160/extras/186db654236f407100f8b5ad2bbef891.webm?t=1770854821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2592160/extras/186db654236f407100f8b5ad2bbef891.mp4?t=1770854821\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2592160/extras/ec98e5243f8747551c05e039295d9727.poster.avif?t=1770854821\" width=780 height=66 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2592160/extras/ec98e5243f8747551c05e039295d9727.webm?t=1770854821\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.a