</i>)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >and <strong>Jeffrey Wright</strong> (<i>American Fiction, The Batman, Casino Royale</i>)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Dispatch is a superhero workplace comedy where choices matter. Manage a dysfunctional team of misfit heroes and strategize who to send to emergencies around the city, all while balancing office politics, personal relationships, and your own quest to become a hero. All episodes out now!", "supported_languages": "англійська<strong>*</strong>, французька, італійська, німецька, іспанська (Іспанія), японська, корейська, китайська (спрощена), португальська (Бразилія), російська, китайська (традиційна)<br><strong>*</strong>повністю озвучено цими мовами", "reviews": "“I truly believe this is one of the greatest games of all-time.”<br>10/10 – GAMINGbible<br><br>“One of the best superhero TV shows around.”<br>89/100 – PC Gamer<br><br>“A true spiritual successor to the Telltale Games of the 2010s...”<br>9/10 – IGN<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2592160/header.jpg?t=1770854821", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2592160/925ffa7e3699d5c9c1369be5d4c3369f0e907e00/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770854821", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2592160/925ffa7e3699d5c9c1369be5d4c3369f0e907e00/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770854821", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Мінімальні:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>ОС:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit) or later<br></li><li><strong>Процесор:</strong> Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-6402p CPU / AMD Ryzen 5 1600 or higher<br></li><li><strong>Оперативна пам’ять:</strong> 2 GB ОП<br></li><li><strong>Відеокарта:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX960 / AMD Radeon RX560<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong>